  "summary": "The study fabricated three distinct self-supporting electrodes: a pristine delaminated Ti3C2Tx paper and two oxidant-free PPy/Ti3C2Tx composites with 1:2 and 1:1 PPy:Ti3C2Tx labels. Ti3C2Tx was prepared by LiF/HCl etching of Ti3AlC2, delaminated, then pyrrole was polymerized in situ between MXene layers. PPy/Ti3C2Tx (1:2) was the headline electrode, delivering 416 F g\u22121 and 1000 F cm\u22123 at 5 mV s\u22121 in 1 M H2SO4. The paper states that the 1:1 composition had lower capacitance but does not print its numerical capacitance; no numerical pristine-film capacitance produced in this study is printed."
